## 12. Success Metrics

### Product Metrics
- 1 real catalog processed end-to-end
- >70% of product rows pass baseline extraction without full manual reconstruction
- uncertain records available for manual correction
- search returns products by SKU and name
- API returns usable JSON

### Business Metrics
- tool enables completion of first real client project
- reduces manual effort versus ad-hoc scripts
- can be reused for future client projects

---

## 13. Risks

### Technical Risks
- difficult PDFs with poor layout
- merged cells in tables
- OCR errors
- low-quality scanned documents

### Product Risks
- trying to build too broad an MVP
- relying too heavily on AI too early
- lack of human-in-the-loop workflow

### Operational Risks
- overly complex UI for a single operator
- too large a stack for the first launch

---

## 14. Product Principles

- MVP must be pragmatic
- human-in-the-loop is mandatory
- AI should be used selectively
- the system must help deliver real client projects
- architecture must allow future extension without overengineering the first version